        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 11,
        "end_line": 19
      },
      "excerpt": "Description:\n\n🐛 Describe the bug\n\nThe result of applying softmax before and after an inverse permutation should be mathematically equivalent.\n\nHowever, torch.softmax produces slightly different results when using permute or transpose operations.\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:737c5f1bda6986b3225eba71e2c665bb82d6676557e874b40a385dbb5580507e"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_api_reference_e8b41bd5f1d9",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "api_reference",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 11,
        "end_line": 19
      },
      "excerpt": "Description:\n\n🐛 Describe the bug\n\nThe result of applying softmax before and after an inverse permutation should be mathematically equivalent.\n\nHowever, torch.softmax produces slightly different results when using permute or transpose operations.\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:737c5f1bda6986b3225eba71e2c665bb82d6676557e874b40a385dbb5580507e"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_reproduction_91a07548ea15",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "reproduction",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 20,
        "end_line": 43
      },
      "excerpt": "Reproduction:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\nval = torch.tensor(\n    [[7.76308536529541015625,\n      7.17303562164306640625,\n      5.13778305053710937500]],\n    dtype=torch.float32,\n    device='cpu'\n)\n\nval1 = val.softmax(dim=1, dtype=torch.float32).permute(1, 0)\n\nval2 = val.permute(1, 0).softmax(dim=0, dtype=torch.float32)\n\nprint(val1)\n\nprint(val2)\n\nprint((val1 - val2).abs().max())\nObserved output:\ntensor(2.9802e-08)",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:3050426082adedcb02cb0b121e525dbe1db13ef0d7d6befffa067c48504575f0"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_expected_behavior_eebd101cf11b",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "expected_behavior",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 44,
        "end_line": 59
      },
      "excerpt": "Expected behavior:\nThe following two computations should produce identical results:\ntensor.softmax(dim=d)\n\ntensor.permute(...).softmax(dim=0).permute(...)\nAdditional example:\nThe issue also appears with float64:\ntorch.tensor(\n    [[0, -0.5, float.fromhex('-0x1.205p+1')]],\n    dtype=torch.float64,\n    device='cpu'\n)\nAffected conditions:\n- softmax operation\n- permute / transpose tensor layout changes\n- floating point tensors",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:6eeded2c42dda4024a8f040bfe0c4b195a880e34b6158547a5908f9166ca6e5e"
    },
